WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:18.618
The whole riverbank was worried.

2
00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:22.077
"Rat was away all night," said a squirrel.

3
00:00:22.078 --> 00:00:25.964
"Mole is gone too," said a robin.

4
00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:30.878
"Maybe they went to the Wild Wood!" said a deer.

5
00:00:30.879 --> 00:00:35.209
When Otter heard, he was worried too.

6
00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.446
"Can you find them?" asked the squirrel.

7
00:00:38.447 --> 00:00:42.078
"I'll look for Badger's house," Otter told them.

8
00:00:42.079 --> 00:00:46.608
"When animals get in trouble, he often helps."

9
00:00:46.609 --> 00:00:51.349
The Wild Wood was cold and empty.

10
00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:55.220
Otter found no one to ask for news.

11
00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:59.347
Then he saw a rabbit hopping by.

12
00:00:59.348 --> 00:01:03.468
"Did you see my friend Mole?" asked Otter.

13
00:01:03.469 --> 00:01:07.601
"Ahh!" screamed the rabbit, turning around.

14
00:01:07.602 --> 00:01:10.216
"You scared me!"

15
00:01:10.217 --> 00:01:13.410
"Have you seen Mole?" Otter said again.

16
00:01:13.411 --> 00:01:16.213
"Well . . . ," said the rabbit.

17
00:01:16.214 --> 00:01:18.404
"Why do you ask?"

18
00:01:18.405 --> 00:01:22.029
"Don't play games," said Otter.

19
00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:23.607
"Did you see him?"

20
00:01:23.608 --> 00:01:27.268
Otter hit the rabbit on the head.

21
00:01:27.269 --> 00:01:31.407
"Ow!" cried the rabbit, rubbing his head.

22
00:01:31.408 --> 00:01:34.341
"You mean Rat's friend?"

23
00:01:34.342 --> 00:01:36.609
The rabbit laughed.

24
00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.476
"I told all the other rabbits.

25
00:01:39.477 --> 00:01:42.071
They thought it was very funny.

26
00:01:42.072 --> 00:01:47.339
Mole got lost, and he was soo scared!"

27
00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:52.359
"Why didn't you do something?" Otter asked.

28
00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:55.203
"Like what?" asked the rabbit.

29
00:01:55.204 --> 00:01:56.874
"Take him in!

30
00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:59.275
Help him!" said Otter.

31
00:01:59.276 --> 00:02:04.464
"What? Us?" said the rabbit, confused.

32
00:02:04.465 --> 00:02:08.877
"You expect us rabbits to help anyone?"

33
00:02:08.878 --> 00:02:14.755
Shaking his head, Otter hurried on.
